OL,3,GNEWSACraig Charles' tribute to 'city
OL,4,Athat shaped me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor and presenter Craig Charles said
OL,7,Fhis latest work had given him a chance
OL,8,Fto reflect on the city which shaped
OL,9,Fhim.
OL,11,FCharles' new spoken word piece pays
OL,12,Ftribute to his home city of Liverpool
OL,13,Fin honour of National Poetry Day.
OL,15,FHis performance coincides with the 50th
OL,16,Fanniversary of him winning a poetry
OL,17,Fcompetition aged 12, which he said had
OL,18,Fchanged his life.
